    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Changes
    in expectations as to our future financial performance, including financial estimates by securities analysts and investors, or differences
    between our actual results and those expected by investors and securities analysts;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
