<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
income tax provision differs from the amount of income tax determined by applying the applicable statutory income tax rate to pretax
loss due to the following for the years ended April 30, 2023 and 2022:</span></p>

