assets as of April 30, 2022 &#8211; Discontinued Operations:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;<span id="xdx_8BF_zS55T0AWOdM3" style="display: none">SCHEDULE OF DISCONTINUED OPERATIONS</span></span></p>

